/-!
# A094102

Triangle read by rows in which row n contains Fib(1), ..., Fib(n-1), Fib(n), Fib(n-1), ..., Fib(1).

The 100 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A094102

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1,
    1, 2, 3, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 3,
    5, 3, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5,
